      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A simulation's picture is a picture like any other. The slime mold's Density is a number per pixel, so a Cosine Gradient colors it, its palette turned once a loop by the gear, and a Kaleidoscope folds the whole thing into six. Try Mirror in place of the Kaleidoscope, or another preset on the mold."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
